{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-anima/1546848-anyone-got-the-book","id":1546848,"title":"Anyone got the Book?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Anima"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-12-10T12:17:34-08:00","id":1546848,"title":"Anyone got the Book?","content":"Anyone got their book yet? If they started being sent out on the 26th the first few should show up soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-27T10:34:39-08:00","id":1547276,"title":"","content":"My book got here! I've only had the chance to glance at it. I will give my first reactions later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-27T13:14:56-08:00","id":1547282,"title":"","content":"Mine arrived on the 23rd and I had to look at it forlornly through my door bell cam until I got home last night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-27T15:58:09-08:00","id":1547288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Slagheap</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-anima/1546848-anyone-got-the-book?p=1547282#post1547282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mine arrived on the 23rd and I had to look at it forlornly through my door bell cam until I got home last night.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hate it for you. But you got your book!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-27T16:02:47-08:00","id":1547289,"title":"","content":"Glancing a bit more at Anima I can see we are going to want a tech as advantages and disadvantages book. Some useful technologies would logically come with disadvantages. Other technologies would come in different qualities. These qualities might be distributed by wealth or social class. <br /> <br /> We'll also want a book on different available game worlds within the game world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-06T05:53:29-08:00","id":1547578,"title":"","content":"I would recommend <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a>'s <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a>. It's got a lot of stuff that I <i>wouldn't </i>use for <b>TC:Anima</b>; but it's designed so that you can easily excise those parts that are too much. <br /> <br /> That said: frankly, I think that <b>TC:Anima</b> is too tame. My version of it would treat <b>Supertech</b> as a required book, with a focus on Augmented and Synthetic Characters, and with Inspired and Powered Science being restricted to Bionics and Neuronics. Even with those restrictions, you still end up with something far more gonzo than <b>TC:Anima</b> contemplates. Thematically, I would include Synthetic Characters to help emphasize the blurring of man and machine that the cyberpunk genre often features, and which would be part of the dehumanizing effect of this era's technology that causes its overall rejection afterward; and I'd include Neuronics to emphasize the dangers of Glass in making the human mind subject to hacking and technological manipulation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-06T12:51:59-08:00","id":1547604,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the reference! It is indeed made with the idea of \u201cpick whatever fits the setting\u201d, so you may use the packages as you suggested. Neuronics and Bionics are specially good for Cyberpunk.<br /> <br /> You could even play Cyberpunk with nothing more than the tags available for advanced science. You can build a lot of cybernetics and minor artificial intelligences with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}